# Design system (Noir Glass)

Look up tokens before inventing new ones:

- Colors: `grep '^const' lib/resources/styles/app_colors.dart`
- Text: `grep 'static TextStyle' lib/resources/styles/app_text_styles.dart`
- Glass/CTA: `AppDecorations` in `lib/resources/styles/app_decorations.dart`
- Widgets: `ls lib/ui/widgets/` (`CommonButton`, `CommonAppBar`, `NoirScaffoldBody`, fields, popups, bottom sheets)

```dart
// ✅
padding: EdgeInsets.all(Dimens.d16.responsive()),
style: AppTextStyles.s18wBoldBlack(),
color: primaryColor,
decoration: AppDecorations.glassPanel(),
Text(S.current.createWallet)

// ❌
EdgeInsets.all(16), TextStyle(...), Color(0xFF...), Text('Create wallet')
```

Every `Dimens` value must call `.responsive()`. Scaffold body: `NoirScaffoldBody`.
